# Claude Code: share only docs (*.md) with the team — never the .json config
# (launch.json, settings.local.json…). Overrides the global ~/.gitignore_global
# that ignores .claude/ entirely.
!.claude/
.claude/**
!.claude/**/
!.claude/**/*.md
